! Samsung Tizen custom rules for AdGuard Home. DNS-only profile: nothing here was seen by this project.
! Every group cites its sources and is unverified until a Samsung set has run behind a gateway (see
! docs/reference/profile-format.md, "Grading evidence"). The listed blocklists ([adguard] filters) do most of the
! work; this file pins what the profile relies on being blocked, since upstream lists change daily.
! The must-allow exceptions are generated from [must_allow] in samsung-tizen.toml; never write them here.

! ---- ACR (Samsung-operated, video fingerprinting) ----
! Unverified. IMC 2024 (Anselmi et al.) and PoPETs 2027 ("Watching the Watchers") both identify
! acr-us-prd.samsungcloud.tv, log-ingestion.samsungacr.com and log-config.samsungacr.com as Samsung's ACR
! endpoints; IMC 2024 adds acr-eu-prd.samsungcloud.tv and log-ingestion-eu.samsungacr.com in the UK.
! HaGeZi's Samsung list blocks samsungacr.com and acr-<region>-prd.samsungcloud.tv for nine regions.
! samsungcloud.tv also carries TV Plus logos and guide data, so the rule is a regex on the acr- hosts, never the zone.
! Sources: https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.06203
!          https://watchingthewatchers.github.io/watchingthewatchers/paper.html
!          https://github.com/hagezi/dns-blocklists/blob/main/adblock/native.samsung.txt
||samsungacr.com^
/^acr-[a-z]{2}-prd\.samsungcloud\.tv$/
! Not pinned: acr0.samsungcloudsolution.com (IMC 2024, UK). HaGeZi blocks it; Perflyst withdrew it after a
! report it cites (oisd thread). The HaGeZi list keeps it blocked; lift that list's entry if a feature needs it.

! ---- Samsung ads ----
! Unverified. samsungads.com: ad configuration and logging (config., rtb-config., tvp-ads-log. in the
! PoPETs 2027 capture; IMC 2024 names samsungads.com as ad tracking). samsungadhub.com, samsungtvads.com and
! samsungads.adsmeasurement.com: HaGeZi Samsung list; ad.samsungadhub.com and ads.samsungads.com: Perflyst.
! Sources: https://github.com/hagezi/dns-blocklists/blob/main/adblock/native.samsung.txt
!          https://github.com/Perflyst/PiHoleBlocklist/blob/master/SmartTV.txt
!          https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.06203
||samsungads.com^
||samsungadhub.com^
||samsungtvads.com^
||samsungads.adsmeasurement.com^

! ---- Samsung telemetry ----
! Unverified. Device logs and crash dumps; both lists carry the crash-dump host, HaGeZi the device log.
! Sources: https://github.com/hagezi/dns-blocklists/blob/main/adblock/native.samsung.txt
!          https://github.com/Perflyst/PiHoleBlocklist/blob/master/SmartTV.txt
||devicelog.samsungcloudsolution.net^
||prderrordumphsm.samsungcloudsolution.com^

! ---- Rejected: not used as rules ----
! Perflyst's list blocks www.samsungotn.net, which its own comments say software updates need, and its
! regex extension blocks the whole samsungcloudsolution.net zone, where those comments put the firmware hosts
! (otnprd8-11). Its comments and issue #82 also place the clock, apps and HbbTV under samsungcloudsolution.com
! and samsungqbe.com, so this profile lists those zones in never_block_apex and does not subscribe to that list.
! Source: https://github.com/Perflyst/PiHoleBlocklist/blob/master/regex.list
